0020130222212/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/uthrowing.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>던지는 \n                무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>완드</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Elite \nUniques</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>아머</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020130222212/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Exceptional Unique Spears \n                             \n                            </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[익셉셔널 유니크 스피어]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/impaler.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>The \nImpaler</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>War Spear</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(24-27) To (88.8-99.9)</font> (56.4-63.45 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n31<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Required Dexterity: 25<br>Durability: 30<br>Base \nWeapon Speed: [-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+140-170% Enhanced \nDamage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">40% Chance Of Open \nWounds</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20% Increased Attack Speed</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Ignore Target's Defense</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150 To \nAttack Rating</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Prevent Monster Heal</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+5 To Impale (Amazon Only)</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To \nPower Strike (Amazon Only)</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>양손데미지 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(24-27) To (88.8-99.9)</font> (56.4-63.45 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : \n31<br>힘 요구치 : 25<br>덱스 요구치: 25<br>내구력 : 30<br>무기기본속도 : [-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+140-170%증가된 데미지 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">40% 기회로 상처 회복 저지</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+20% 공격속도 증가</font><br><font color=